#: scenario4:scenario4_EF1A17E8_E766_4047_942C_3956E1C7BE73
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5388b10f3daf2b94c96abfd494c36a95e085ab7c651e10219319e5be2f76f716
#. default-sha256: 7145fec738259d6563ce1b8ab772b5095c8589fd948c6b9fe25b4ef30ef9f802
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EF1A17E8_E766_4047_942C_3956E1C7BE73"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Master, ⟪k:31⟫"
"Master... ⟪k:32⟫Please, wake up... ⟪k:33⟫Return to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Maître, ⟪k:31⟫"
"Maître... ⟪k:32⟫Je vous en prie, réveillez-vous... ⟪k:33⟫Revenez-moi."

#: scenario4:scenario4_503D27F7_8B5F_43A6_939E_1AA8BB215BAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4db1daaba384d6e5bc917d03dfa477f0cd667e7c5393025d6b7ea1ac03aa9bf7
#. default-sha256: 0a05a8e3cda97b5319e07e154908b59117cd41c0388c08c0fcf102540256b1b0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_503D27F7_8B5F_43A6_939E_1AA8BB215BAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Ahh, have you come to, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Ahh, vous revenez à vous, Maître ?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B6BED36E_D636_466F_9CB0_E46702883FBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9c04560670350da974f5da2068b3497b1661047ae7617841895310128fe4f51
#. default-sha256: 3ecbacc3f4f0a3444f9673729e4466ed109edc49389c54c282ef0192063bdb6e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B6BED36E_D636_466F_9CB0_E46702883FBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫I apologize for sending you through the door without warning. ⟪k:2⟫It must have "
"given you quite the scare."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Héhé... ⟪k:1⟫Je suis désolée de vous avoir envoyé dans cette porte sans avertissement. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Cela a dû vous faire peur."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F4926009_F4AB_479C_B9E1_F997361B0A47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e87927e82d9e59e34fa32647cb903a9580a5bc34d069d5fb953b2ee1f94091e1
#. default-sha256: 438a5e1e9a682209d7eb846837660dd505f587736b6fe1c9c1aa53475d33602e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F4926009_F4AB_479C_B9E1_F997361B0A47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I beg your forgiveness. ⟪k:1⟫I heard a terrible screaming from down the stairs, and I "
"panicked."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais j’implore votre pardon. ⟪k:1⟫J’ai entendu un cri terrible en bas des escaliers et j’ai "
"paniqué."

#: scenario4:scenario4_4829A852_0DB6_42A3_A350_3736771CD151
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3466014e52a6af59385fea73cc7ab35dcce95b9eec016d14e40e1b9091bd265a
#. default-sha256: 9e45732fdc2495481289a97d8aac12c169c561c9f654efdbbde798072122511f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_4829A852_0DB6_42A3_A350_3736771CD151"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You say you saw the White-Haired Girl? ⟪k:1⟫I see, so you made it into the world beyond the "
"door before me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vous dites avoir vu la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs ? ⟪k:1⟫Je vois, donc vous m’avez devancée "
"dans ce monde."

#: scenario4:scenario4_CE8E1503_DC64_4929_80B3_3ECAA6DED4C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bb5d88b5f4c465ffbc4a0a92338d8bf8715fcf49f876f237cb0814a7090c08e
#. default-sha256: e819e655a6263c616b15b5cd9bba8e35120540af300f925924c31d7f330eb6b6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CE8E1503_DC64_4929_80B3_3ECAA6DED4C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I am deeply relieved that I was able to take your hand before losing sight of you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je suis vraiment soulagée d’avoir pu vous prendre la main avant de vous perdre."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A89676AB_8E73_4969_BFD6_ECF5DFBA303F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8922a7057a177ac48c6c66a63585902b3a0e59e36d0190cbd1b72da5cccb6d39
#. default-sha256: 8f3bc887ca9faa62b5c1410e879b87928f69069434777875bf3f393d7a848e74
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A89676AB_8E73_4969_BFD6_ECF5DFBA303F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I presume you have already grown familiar with the atmosphere of this time period, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je suppose que vous avez déjà pu vous familiariser avec l’ambiance du lieu, Maître ?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_DC3DF9C7_9FBF_40AE_988A_CE94D3BAA312
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88a2be76845fb63b093f92c43108a6cefbeca5091fe3b663181e1b270a3fe9a3
#. default-sha256: e27c26398ac07d8408ebc6dc7363f2e72ba31ad1896bbef53c2dad259f2c0771
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DC3DF9C7_9FBF_40AE_988A_CE94D3BAA312"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you have seen her, as you said, then you should have a basic grasp of the situation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si vous l’avez vue, comme vous le dites, alors vous devez comprendre de quoi il en retourne."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B0DE5C00_C06F_41F7_84D9_244D3E94237F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdc600ac151487f09a8da4f04aa80bbbf9d0cf2acea715e94de80ae3eabe9858
#. default-sha256: 1eef68b652bac5da4d689a93d463f590fa8872a457d9e4723deac53b8980dcbf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B0DE5C00_C06F_41F7_84D9_244D3E94237F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was a very misfortunate girl in this era, accused of being a witch, abused and "
"persecuted. ⟪k:1⟫Her life was in constant danger."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle était très malheureuse à cette époque ; on l’accusait d’être une sorcière et elle était "
"donc maltraitée et persécutée. ⟪k:1⟫Sa vie était constamment en danger."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5B14F580_3322_4667_81E2_C62F6B032F8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85a26466badc395ccc06366194249b7497812eefeeef5862948a21eb94bf0c08
#. default-sha256: ec788fcdb5a6cb3b8fe60ce4be5777a9df4e00088f57c9eeea012a64c1b36e62
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5B14F580_3322_4667_81E2_C62F6B032F8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was, again, her appearance that brought this upon her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That snow-white hair and "
"those ruby-red eyes⟪k:3⟫clearly differentiated her from everyone else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Encore une fois, c’est son apparence qui lui valait cela.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ses cheveux blanc neige "
"et ces yeux rouges comme deux rubis⟪k:3⟫la différenciaient clairement du reste de la population."

#: scenario4:scenario4_216105B8_88CE_4A72_8B7B_472E05F650C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfbe55574f8cadb52f97a0f99978bc88bd4311ecc3abe5f3e30f271437aabc59
#. default-sha256: 309d4bca9e6bf1fdbf085bac89d131bf6c9c48bfe81f5187358152f855ef4562
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_216105B8_88CE_4A72_8B7B_472E05F650C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, and I apologize.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I neglected to mention that this door is... ⟪k:3⟫unique."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, veuillez m’excuser.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫J’ai oublié de vous dire que cette porte est... ⟪k:3⟫"
"spéciale."

#: scenario4:scenario4_65367644_11A3_4D7F_86E4_F52198CE1EB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9850d6cedd06c5c0723c2a8c3fed1dd947582610f3019570b409c9dfb3f03588
#. default-sha256: cce96e64d19bbb21807582e9b0cff2b74c5550022510d4eb79cb97d5b74d83a3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_65367644_11A3_4D7F_86E4_F52198CE1EB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As for ⟪k:1⟫what⟪k:2⟫ sets it apart... ⟪k:3⟫that will be made clear as we proceed, though "
"one difference is in the time period."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫En quoi⟪k:2⟫ est-elle spéciale... ? ⟪k:3⟫Cela viendra en temps voulu, mais déjà, il y a "
"une différence dans la période temporelle."

#: scenario4:scenario4_39697E4D_326A_4396_A090_794433BA31D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc7f693b55956e4f80eafd0d1df4b0fde77e7978d3071c36efc88e918d86afaf
#. default-sha256: 075a2bc1183e938b18ff2f4154405f4b720f1d453e66aefeac0ae1741a728403
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_39697E4D_326A_4396_A090_794433BA31D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tales I have shown you began with that of the beautiful flaxen-haired family, followed "
"by the tale of the bloodthirsty beast, and then the tale of steel and ambition—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les contes que je vous ai montrés ont commencé avec la famille aux cheveux blonds, ont "
"continué avec celui de la bête assoiffée de sang, et ensuite avec celui de l’acier et de "
"l’ambition—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_D8B7DF58_C837_4E48_9E3D_AF6E8C6DF8CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb3e6c114eeca82e9ff909c5a0afa778b3f6745f0508e3e5ed704b559f2eb00f
#. default-sha256: 39f7cc19055a5327065ce20967f2a6e9a739d47bf51cf41e6f940e801de8e843
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8B7DF58_C837_4E48_9E3D_AF6E8C6DF8CE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫proceeding in chronological order."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ils suivaient tous un ordre chronologique."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7067907_DA0C_4EB9_8D7D_6640B2D55A9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 952a6e7c92ed171ef5e3c8ca03b5f33e85e5f34e9ce3263b3cc483d544772047
#. default-sha256: 03e63faceee76aeb2dc36972a2ed01b11ac4167be6bcf00515739087b010619e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7067907_DA0C_4EB9_8D7D_6640B2D55A9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the door we have just entered takes us to the period now known as the Middle Ages—"
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫long, long before the other three tales."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pourtant, la porte dans laquelle nous venons d’entrer nous emmène à la période connue "
"aujourd’hui sous le nom de Moyen ⟪k:1⟫Â⟪k:2⟫ge—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ bien, bien longtemps avant les trois "
"autres contes."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F51BB548_F386_48E9_8932_FEEBFC358CEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16b34a2670d4c83a37540b4cb15fc6a0a7b10a6d3bd3b4af52bfc8579a333b8b
#. default-sha256: 99eb4d537ee69e629c18eae909e23cb37b3316fd9939920f4f1451662b331043
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F51BB548_F386_48E9_8932_FEEBFC358CEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Yes, that is correct—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫this is where it all began."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Oui, c’est exact—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ c’est bien là que tout a commencé."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B080792D_0CD8_44B3_8B25_6D9B097B6DDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38f03cc4504d4083d62adb1bc848e3b6a104beb1a7ce2616503fe53ac0eff149
#. default-sha256: e6783c491a539109f289fb774cc47537dec011aa7c1605847457c7edaf218e27
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B080792D_0CD8_44B3_8B25_6D9B097B6DDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion’s curse, the truth of the witch, and Your identity—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫all of this should "
"be made known."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La malédiction du manoir, la vérité sur la sorcière ainsi que votre identité—⟪k:1⟫ tout sera "
"révélé."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FD5932F4_9DF0_4A24_A415_6821C45C5F28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8a292711eb1e9c559383f49c4ca4ae703b6fc214a218bd987a27b9c62cfa8e8
#. default-sha256: eef4d121a37c8f9e5aa60a6f658de7667a7c8a41f9314ec26f2b7591452558b6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FD5932F4_9DF0_4A24_A415_6821C45C5F28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If, after this tale, you are still unable to reclaim your old self..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Si, après ce conte, vous êtes toujours incapable de reconquérir votre identité..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7014308B_F4B1_447F_9CB7_5CA77E0FF0E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ee25fb2b5b5192d3dbd137b0e5b03944ad8eca606e34179566b74941aed990a
#. default-sha256: 9af586668d74719650b2b30e2bd6faa8b061a07da97f38ccf512e7e38481851c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7014308B_F4B1_447F_9CB7_5CA77E0FF0E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then there is nothing more I can do."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...je ne pourrai rien faire de plus."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9E0F62D7_DFFD_4981_8761_35EF94496288
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8151af5dcf5d2f20fb70f826e8191fe048ee04cc74e2771729cc7971b48be89
#. default-sha256: 42c505faf3be15d4d0076eed747d18a5d67a567110538748f0f3790d0d537cc5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9E0F62D7_DFFD_4981_8761_35EF94496288"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This door contains the last tale I am able to tell you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Cette porte contient le dernier conte que je puis vous montrer."

#: scenario4:scenario4_88E14716_86DD_462E_B6F6_C4834BBED190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c48ee62dc5316b00b9b11da1611be7b5a68df48e1af93fa11cbd49e1091ae97d
#. default-sha256: a59a1603b82f35c423dc6730465ec82c4ed2bf580b1723f1cc3cdbcd366d58f3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_88E14716_86DD_462E_B6F6_C4834BBED190"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I ask of you, please do not let go of my hand until it is all over."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Alors, je vous en supplie, ne lâchez pas ma main et ce, jusqu’à la fin."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AC56C405_318B_451F_8F8C_D053D0AA1B11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85b972c6dfca9241880c571f3cb4ca615b2255bbae5833617d99ce4b15ce6381
#. default-sha256: 10a3a3a73a72492551af7ff2bd951d273a8b1ef5961bc3235f434064aab11430
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AC56C405_318B_451F_8F8C_D053D0AA1B11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now then... ⟪k:1⟫let us begin a beautiful, tragic love story of two solitary souls trapped "
"in a mansion of darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ présent... ⟪k:3⟫penchons-nous sur la belle histoire d’amour, tragique, de deux "
"âmes solitaires piégées dans un manoir obscur."

#: scenario4:scenario4_CE1D801E_A386_4F81_80B7_82F1195D43E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b082b229dfdd2b441de412ae2c365d515a5bad908136ac2d6ae3a03c0a8736e1
#. default-sha256: 5aa35896b8914efcf687c3ced5ca03727b1e83d650ec89e86ab33a15d7aa083b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CE1D801E_A386_4F81_80B7_82F1195D43E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“In that era, the mansion was a dungeon draped in darkness.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫En ce temps-là, le manoir était un donjon drapé dans les ténèbres."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E35BAA66_2050_4774_B272_0FCB6FDE5585
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd78a933bb719e7178c07b4c7683e562972e99999ff87c1207e61a494b03c18d
#. default-sha256: 1862efd27f4c61577dbbbe67c4e4ced1a8ecdee90f31ad34a8d3587525ca3989
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E35BAA66_2050_4774_B272_0FCB6FDE5585"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"After a great deal of time on the run, the White-Haired Girl found herself at a remote mansion "
"that stood in a dark, overgrown forest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"Après avoir couru pendant des jours et des jours, la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs se retrouva devant "
"un manoir reculé situé dans une forêt sombre et épaisse."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AFEBC3C4_5AF7_4030_B83A_9E34957C8E95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2984f4dceca1e2e3199dee25b5ee322f7911668363ebc998328823376051c92
#. default-sha256: 53b483f8bd6091028e86b567f2c2481dbc03aba4093f63ebf8c4acc8f04990d6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AFEBC3C4_5AF7_4030_B83A_9E34957C8E95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫All the windows were either boarded or shuttered, and it was even darker inside the house "
"than out. ⟪k:1⟫Not even a ray of moonlight could enter those walls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Toutes les fenêtres étaient soit fermées soit condamnées, et il faisait encore plus noir à "
"l’intérieur qu’à l’extérieur. ⟪k:1⟫Même la lune ne pouvait pénétrer ces murs."

#: scenario4:scenario4_ADB062E9_E426_4361_A74B_446D17D80C5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cec543a518322e3dce32db1a3dab5b0d573aad2d9f15017613ec06b39a058d53
#. default-sha256: 910827f1e6f6a27c316a44a2f60dd78fcc91c8712b09c709646d7bb0a830ed23
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_ADB062E9_E426_4361_A74B_446D17D80C5C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Only naturally, the White-Haired Girl⟪k:1⟫had assumed that nobody lived there,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est pourquoi il est normal que la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs⟪k:1⟫ait supposé que personne "
"n’y vivait..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_BB7025AD_075F_449F_AF2C_A1E7C0EAB154
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99ac7721d6c45472079b75c924567bc55162d6324c3991f3860c7a557a929e48
#. default-sha256: 385931e7e26a215209560c51ab7eec243a9e01f53183ed9ee625dd914251b8e0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BB7025AD_075F_449F_AF2C_A1E7C0EAB154"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but her guess was incorrect.⟪k:1⟫Someone did, indeed, dwell in the house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...mais elle se trompait.⟪k:1⟫Quelqu’un résidait bien dans la maison."

#: scenario4:scenario4_063519C7_29A5_48FC_982F_67086C2728C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 506bd8e8d83f8f7fd944fdc7a6c1d10c9b9295bb897ba48012ce312bb8de9649
#. default-sha256: 1cdbc5ed92b6c7239f6eaaf9dc6d7420cc8c16aed6b78e945c93c0fe86e338e2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_063519C7_29A5_48FC_982F_67086C2728C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a young man named Michel. ⟪k:1⟫Though she could not make out the details of his face "
"in the candlelight, she thought him a very handsome man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était un jeune homme du nom de Michel. ⟪k:1⟫Même si elle ne distinguait pas bien les "
"contours de son visage à la lumière de la bougie, elle le trouva très bel homme."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D06033B_76FB_4AD6_B6E2_689D1E6CB834
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 556ca06a38d79bc76963f8671dae876fd824b15b78a9682925d6c5a0c741f333
#. default-sha256: 6e66b6cf286e211ed50170b602e091c8fd493623444a15f72b994e4d5d3bb98f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D06033B_76FB_4AD6_B6E2_689D1E6CB834"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, he proclaimed to her that a witch resided within the mansion, and that he too was "
"cursed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il affirmait qu’une sorcière vivait au manoir et que lui aussi était maudit."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F97B061F_C94C_4E47_9083_4DF3A43CF7F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7c6c8c434da1c7fef0ec05d9868cc7a7f186a6acce197b3a59fc1ec7e40d77e
#. default-sha256: c4b7fa25d7f8bc66e2f36a85a0daba52ed40e7f5b741a9d63e6d8d508b830dc4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F97B061F_C94C_4E47_9083_4DF3A43CF7F4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everyone who got close to him lost their lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tous ceux qui s’approchaient de lui perdaient la vie."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D46E1850_A638_4423_8478_E8299693BAC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2981e3c72298d1b9af5ba104d68b5def66e8ed2ada9a723a60729287c7e6771
#. default-sha256: 3e11b8296fa65c95b92ddfb9846224e1544a9a510b67201f41b3e040ffd37dbc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D46E1850_A638_4423_8478_E8299693BAC6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do you think that what he told her was all nonsense?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A lie devised to chase her out "
"of the house?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Croyez-vous qu’il ne lui ait dit que des absurdités ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Que c’était un mensonge "
"élaboré pour la chasser de la maison ?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_887E6F9E_D819_4002_A13F_1F6FE4BFC4CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55fc525315975ab6b29cb4d568aaecc39c71863bc08dfc1ecdba9f2948f49fa9
#. default-sha256: 0d0738f949ab53b2cf54f972edfa8279a68f6d0aeb09eecf4999a6029ac2d53d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_887E6F9E_D819_4002_A13F_1F6FE4BFC4CE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The truth of the matter shall come to light in time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La vérité sera révélée en temps voulu."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DAE10AA8_CF55_4E6B_8531_40A384D97174
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b999751b01e36be03d427a5f7ad80c1f307d35df50028b2655c3e40e4851fdb4
#. default-sha256: dc6b29c71ad3db10adcdfd99e65d8193386fcf912e21fd1adbfb5ee4b7067903
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DAE10AA8_CF55_4E6B_8531_40A384D97174"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Despite Michel’s assertions, the White-Haired Girl decided she would take up "
"residence within the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Malgré les affirmations de Michel, la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs décida de séjourner "
"au manoir."

#: scenario4:scenario4_667912EF_7C4A_4A04_A635_6ED2F38EABC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7264f73da1efd3495ab5708fb7af23e1fc9e293da466f3228ba120b5cfaec37
#. default-sha256: e7924fab8d8118876681b388d2acc8e9b344481d4b9b6cace16d0473bbc9f889
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_667912EF_7C4A_4A04_A635_6ED2F38EABC0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This era’s White-Haired Girl was younger than the others; ⟪k:1⟫she was still in her early "
"teens, young enough to be seen as still a child."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs de cette époque était plus jeune que lors des autres contes ; "
"⟪k:1⟫elle était encore adolescente et paraissait assez jeune pour qu’on la voie encore comme une "
"enfant."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D2425DFE_6D2B_4CFA_945A_6627E9588E3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58edc4a7dd40caa0251c3ebf7dd127a07a7d969af81d7465c491a7cdc2185ce7
#. default-sha256: 5872839f479b051be9f75bd12adf8b5c510ad8fe8c0a99c8435d718ae567526c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D2425DFE_6D2B_4CFA_945A_6627E9588E3D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But she was neither as self-centered nor irresponsible as you might expect of someone her "
"age. ⟪k:1⟫She was very delicate and reserved, and acted with a great deal of modesty and "
"restraint."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais elle n’était pas aussi égocentrique ou irresponsable que son âge pouvait le laisser "
"entendre. ⟪k:1⟫Elle était très délicate et réservée, et se comportait avec modestie et retenue."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5F668DAB_F665_40A3_8C34_2A2FB0ACC034
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa04a4a6009cfed3e383b5d4fe5b180437aa43e5b35fe6192e30587d52ee8ee4
#. default-sha256: 32d1bc33a586ff2de5c7cf0af1efee5d53b41e64bf1836337fda6efad1790f6e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5F668DAB_F665_40A3_8C34_2A2FB0ACC034"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The accusations of her being a criminal and a sinner were grossly inappropriate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les accusations la décrivant comme une criminelle et une pécheresse étaient tout à fait "
"grotesques."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3E99F111_B2C5_4066_BB9C_80997DD2F721
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8603ff5688e64908d26742e1ad1f03aeb0bacf879b313f6d15dc6d0314208db
#. default-sha256: 331b2b1413ef0c397a53c7ee68cb9fb0289e8d00585437868544890617f24109
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3E99F111_B2C5_4066_BB9C_80997DD2F721"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, she was still chased from her home, barely managing to flee to this mansion "
"with her life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Néanmoins, elle fut chassée de sa maison et échappa de peu à ses poursuivants, pour se "
"retrouver dans ce manoir."

#: scenario4:scenario4_850175EC_D1E2_45B3_9009_E5E6C4FD45CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc5ec4d481d791dd1f1d4d6fb976c316c7aa201d3db2006e6ce2897502664c60
#. default-sha256: 2725688a4def11ccbde0ad6d1235392a4bc362ec4a9f89dd81c31bdb3a8c01ff
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_850175EC_D1E2_45B3_9009_E5E6C4FD45CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, the White-Haired Girl thought it would be rude to simply take up space in the mansion, "
"so she chased down the master, Michel,⟪k:1⟫and asked,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs trouvait grossier de s’imposer ainsi sans rien faire en "
"contrepartie, alors elle se mit en quête du maître, Michel, et lui demanda :"

#: scenario4:scenario4_564B2023_C5DB_4394_B3B1_ABF82315653B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3963e1679ddaf23893b5e2c56c45095f7f0087b900ac67bf8a22db8495e5e7ec
