msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il prononça ces mots sans aucune émotion, se détourna et s’éloigna."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C5865549_F44E_4E64_96BF_CA4EC9008A78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c93e2a4494a32babf98d375609fbecb7000b30152cd9dc65cfd5cf052f20398
