msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C5865549_F44E_4E64_96BF_CA4EC9008A78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel was not, I believe, spurning her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫he was merely disinterested. ⟪k:3⟫He did "
"not treat her disrespectfully, nor did he seem averse to her presence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je crois que Michel ne la rejetait pas—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ il était seulement indifférent. ⟪k:3⟫Il ne "
"lui manquait pas de respect et n’éprouvait aucune aversion pour elle."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EC91C502_9764_4B00_9534_C62C88A276DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1ca8d5b9ebee6e81e72476e709bff33acd2b11ac33419ed16ad04bf08f5fa69
#. default-sha256: da799d033caf989561fdc84457740e6d7530bb0414b2ae29254f9f26eef7b881
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EC91C502_9764_4B00_9534_C62C88A276DF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Words simply did not seem to affect him at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les mots ne semblaient tout simplement pas l’affecter le moins du monde."

#: scenario4:scenario4_54050BD7_BD20_4F3F_89D2_ACF387428879
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f261beb0296d1990d8554b03f85f1955d293e20257b038d016fcd05fff20e945
#. default-sha256: d3978c4e34a5c52684a42bd722aaa607472ef59678bc35ef931c6e794063a9ce
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54050BD7_BD20_4F3F_89D2_ACF387428879"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not only was the mansion a prison for his body, his body was also a prison ensnaring his "
"heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non seulement le manoir était une prison pour son corps mais son corps aussi était une "
"prison enserrant son cœur."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7D6004BB_B5C1_46B7_A5CE_1F03430A4971
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f670737e423c438cd0efcaac4c6dc38a923a321141ac72669c09ab6ddc2f16b
#. default-sha256: 2c8881e396fea20559b047e53c844f59b2df41c849254465d7a499fd56784326
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7D6004BB_B5C1_46B7_A5CE_1F03430A4971"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I should still do whatever I can.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Je devrais quand même faire mon possible pour aider.)"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C646BDA3_4462_4C88_B7FF_B8279C83B0D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4fb1f4a885bbdd4db50b58fae89113b6daf2a8ea7b24aba0f0b5b9dc7204168
#. default-sha256: d8c27b425f5cff2a226e7d0410668402f5a40387e4c565996d6678f9ecb68ccd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C646BDA3_4462_4C88_B7FF_B8279C83B0D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But she did not let that get her down. ⟪k:1⟫In fact, she might have even interpreted his "
"disinterest as kindness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais elle ne se laissa pas abattre. ⟪k:1⟫En fait, il est tout à fait possible qu’elle ait "
"interprété son désintérêt comme de la gentillesse."

#: scenario4:scenario4_13131F31_9A42_41A0_9E64_6EA53DC69456
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfaead5ace3a5a9d2a8e69c9f022ff07c13bd69e46c54797a3a10f7b91bad436
#. default-sha256: 9f3e091f27734acbc3ff9ce2c7eb23c8b142365952be8ecead4361be11a34944
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_13131F31_9A42_41A0_9E64_6EA53DC69456"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though he was a bit standoffish, he did not attempt to cause her harm. ⟪k:1⟫He was nothing "
"like the people who had accused her of being a witch and forced her to flee for her life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il n’essayait pas de lui faire du mal, il était juste un peu distant. ⟪k:1⟫Il ne ressemblait "
"en rien aux gens qui l’accusaient d’être une sorcière et qui l’avaient forcée à fuir pour sa vie."

#: scenario4:scenario4_40245605_7D13_496B_AAB5_8DF61CBD11F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3338eefd7342b844d1483f923279ad56b5e40fe1ce7f090ce83e18d7594c5dc4
#. default-sha256: 7919e5487b631010a6ee57318a30f9af21bb7e16210a30204138d5fb29bc12ee
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_40245605_7D13_496B_AAB5_8DF61CBD11F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And she was deeply grateful for that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et elle lui en était profondément reconnaissante."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3C7A6950_6D50_412E_B0FA_7756486CE3C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b1ffd37c0e20137b0cf87a307034799d6b3a784da1f4f9389912c258e4e4abd
#. default-sha256: ae98b5705b583c520875c1d4b888ca01d050024f3d39687514087583524ec017
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3C7A6950_6D50_412E_B0FA_7756486CE3C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Thus began their quiet life together—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Michel, who avoided contact with others, "
"and the White-Haired Girl, who had taken a great deal of abuse from others."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C’est ainsi que commença leur vie paisible ensemble—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ Michel, qui évitait le "
"contact humain, et la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs, qui avait subi tant de mauvais traitements."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D41E979_C176_416B_9A55_48944A13EFCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1298c91eb6b49ab09fb239ecfe9f448dcd9293cbaad44b1acd9c44374eb3e5b2
#. default-sha256: 28d1e90ad061521c1cae4371f89fd23254fcb0fed79533174eb04a2e9e3431a0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D41E979_C176_416B_9A55_48944A13EFCE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Two people who knew hardly anything about one another—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫who were too distant to "
"really be said to be living “together.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Deux individus qui ne savaient presque rien l’un de l’autre—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ et qui étaient trop "
"distants pour vraiment pouvoir dire qu’ils vivaient ⟪k:3⟫« ensemble »."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AB6ABACB_5661_491D_B2AC_B361299E2335
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 924abdf8505d09b9fd486db623174d19d6388a9df76f67396bfcc17800b001d3
#. default-sha256: 768928ba56ea7da77c0460841842c9ff1f44c6aa25ad73457fb6436fe03fb3f2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AB6ABACB_5661_491D_B2AC_B361299E2335"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel spent most of his day in his chambers, so they only ever saw each other occasionally, "
"and they hardly ever spoke."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel passait le plus clair de son temps dans sa chambre, donc ils ne se voyaient qu’à de "
"rares occasions, et ils ne se parlaient presque jamais."

#: scenario4:scenario4_57099ACB_C553_4EC9_955F_FAA781ED6BC2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c377dc5f8fdfc3eb50cf0cb2edd0fb7b706e7d3c689bb5b25d89d53de563ca4
#. default-sha256: 414436303b751582df5b446fd5fc7e9dc8a579df998a9546cc684c17e9cad57f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_57099ACB_C553_4EC9_955F_FAA781ED6BC2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though they stayed in the same house,⟪k:1⟫they both still lived solitary lives."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Alors même qu’ils vivaient dans la même maison,⟪k:1⟫ils menaient tous deux des vies très "
"solitaires."

#: scenario4:scenario4_2279AA0A_4CF2_4489_AA22_A8D2847C68CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 286febb1ead31b55a8befe518d0c0b56c989d5954af72ce915912d151587d1d5
#. default-sha256: f9a2055ad3eccda515c4cd6e71051d8f0702520cef4a33b986aa65db4e10cfc4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2279AA0A_4CF2_4489_AA22_A8D2847C68CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, the White-Haired Girl wanted to get to know Michel better."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Néanmoins, la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs voulait apprendre à mieux connaître Michel."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6F15CC23_D3F5_4FEC_993D_333844D58D28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c32082c11cffd2ff72ea9595c09d9ebdb974d3e144739e04cda34541927deb6d
#. default-sha256: 8ee63c202841a036b25ee327952718bbdd192e272c7a66f06824b22e01503cfa
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6F15CC23_D3F5_4FEC_993D_333844D58D28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She wanted to know why he called himself cursed,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle voulait savoir pourquoi il se disait maudit,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BE41FC56_496B_4165_A681_048D619EEEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8af81f584cb154a306f696407734ec5ecd0be2b5afb4cd42db600c7583d41137
#. default-sha256: ebf4892d5a1047f4e38e3d70af0f004b92007cc3f97227db1c5cbc90de4cee89
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BE41FC56_496B_4165_A681_048D619EEEF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫why... ⟪k:1⟫he lived alone in this dark mansion,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫pourquoi... ⟪k:1⟫il vivait tout seul dans ce manoir sombre,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_56924B05_D029_4EF7_86C2_FBCF3E8ECDB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59bff6d377a55a02e135caa34ce8870712b10190acf0412e1355f2e6ccae1978
#. default-sha256: 1a1208c0667ec7f9b3aef1c0c49488739ae6b27a723be35975fe4954a6422cc1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_56924B05_D029_4EF7_86C2_FBCF3E8ECDB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫how many days, how many years he had spent here in solitude."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫combien de jours, combien d’années il avait passés ici, seul."

#: scenario4:scenario4_02943C5C_88AC_4B7C_9445_C1E7DDA92F8E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67a890ad3fd28453278a5425289dfe7cab221de4ef2861dfd63f0347391b2ecc
#. default-sha256: 070c7ced6987add3e49e28cd95cd86d281ed59d91db93c8176ca92974289ada1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_02943C5C_88AC_4B7C_9445_C1E7DDA92F8E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And while she waited for the opportunity, she also started doing things around the house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et en attendant que l’occasion se présente, elle commença à s’activer dans la maison."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FEAE5476_5E22_4BE2_B5CE_EBB1071EF666
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bb030250bea7a4214f0c0f0164a8324d7c1c681518c689ee7cb10364887e2a6
#. default-sha256: 5b1a354cf8117d48798b6a6aacf0e873f1e1602542bebd409ec8bbf4db2bd2b1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FEAE5476_5E22_4BE2_B5CE_EBB1071EF666"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The first project she set out to take care of was cleaning. ⟪k:2⟫As the windows were "
"all firmly shut, her only source of light was candles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Le premier projet auquel elle s’attaqua fut le nettoyage. ⟪k:2⟫Comme toutes les "
"fenêtres étaient closes, sa seule source de lumière était la bougie."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E96CF4DB_B15B_4BF1_ADC2_C15D8B247304
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7773ccedf6d44ad5a6740198b550b1064c2af26c3e3c6ea16b45447e6491c4c9
#. default-sha256: d8bd19a570720f320c751357d90ac6aac98713c3d22b19c0c927bfa116a5a02e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E96CF4DB_B15B_4BF1_ADC2_C15D8B247304"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For whatever reason, there was a great deal of candles stored in the cellar."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pour une raison qui lui échappait, il y avait un grand nombre de bougies conservées dans la "
"cave."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B3569F31_3996_4693_8CB4_72193079A5B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5db9cb1ba4a344618609a7e0572cf2a84ebac3c0252d1f9cca47e9fae17627be
#. default-sha256: 28116a2600daef0cfc735e16f5c33db62704cd913c0008a355a566b392a4dfa4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B3569F31_3996_4693_8CB4_72193079A5B7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wondered where on earth he had acquired so many, but she never found the opportunity to "
"ask him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle se demandait où diable il en avait acquis autant, mais elle ne trouvait jamais "
"l’occasion de lui poser la question."

#: scenario4:scenario4_790671EB_16E3_4500_8067_C875CA673253
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b1b67348229b63deb877a7ae644be47378dc28f17df788e156bc8098a2af510
#. default-sha256: 0bba570e13297fc64e8d5ed46837f8365c3454f88d57d1754738e1b27ef17ac5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_790671EB_16E3_4500_8067_C875CA673253"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was difficult to even see all the dust and cobwebs with only candlelight, and considering "
"the poor airflow through the house, she was afraid her efforts were going to be in vain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il était difficile, armée seulement d’une bougie, ne serait-ce que de voir la poussière et "
"les toiles d’araignée, et vu le peu de circulation d’air dans la maison, elle craignait que ses "
"efforts ne fussent vains."

#: scenario4:scenario4_73075EBA_6725_4B69_BE7A_FC90071FF6BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63312e7e4f9d894ba97edcb151989378b0972b2c2f4d8d8e880ec595ed934aa0
#. default-sha256: a492e86ecc7f2baeb4a660a4c900c2e4e57bab4a164c4cd50dc65b52d542dc43
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_73075EBA_6725_4B69_BE7A_FC90071FF6BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Still she persisted, sweeping and wiping things down, one room at a time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle persévéra quand même, balayant, époussetant, une pièce après l’autre."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A9B09618_AA36_4C3F_8C7A_ECABE6D861FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 171bdc5b7f2f684a1ef638773120a4f6d2e840e009274ba5e6079b5d9fd35913
#. default-sha256: 89294b668ee4952b3b2125c4c6b3c4a612dfbe7fdea637872e941d1cea14e1f7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A9B09618_AA36_4C3F_8C7A_ECABE6D861FF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, she made her way to the library.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The dust that had settled there was "
"much heavier than in any other room; ⟪k:3⟫with each breath, she had to fight back coughs."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Au bout d’un moment, elle se dirigea vers la bibliothèque.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La poussière qui s’y "
"était accumulée était bien plus épaisse qu’ailleurs ; ⟪k:3⟫à chaque respiration, elle devait se "
"retenir de tousser."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1ED3589A_04FC_4AA7_9181_C7023BD6EA65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c9bb2280cf71f601eac944ef5468a98f9ac9fad953f1d083dd48ea9974ef54d
#. default-sha256: a3d3db4b53cfabdf7ea7cc2de7fca3578a9ab542577d1b758a844ea991d08cb8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1ED3589A_04FC_4AA7_9181_C7023BD6EA65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was not a room one would normally be comfortable spending much time in, but the sight of "
"so many bulky volumes lining the shelves sent her heart aflutter with delight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce n’était pas une pièce où l’on se sentait à l’aise, et pourtant, à la vue de de tous ces "
"gros volumes alignés sur les étagères, elle sentit son cœur faire un bond."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AD3E8AC4_00BA_4D0A_A64F_22B99EEF6A3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18247770efd7811dca7f4bf3e06bf29752398f1ae2033f45d7ca4544ce32f270
#. default-sha256: 791ee411a61bcb9833536b8ccb2ad1085fb4bf5c814baa35209196d8a379416c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AD3E8AC4_00BA_4D0A_A64F_22B99EEF6A3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They’re... ⟪k:1⟫books.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Incredible... ⟪k:4⟫Real books."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ce sont... ⟪k:1⟫des livres.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Incroyable... ⟪k:4⟫De vrais livres."

#: scenario4:scenario4_38886115_8108_4B46_86B1_0AA90E57CCA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a33e71bf4abac035190800d74a47d7a4822e362fb6354a795b3167d1f1dad481
#. default-sha256: 4e35a06ca91437650c3ef2ad46df07a7f0666c8b0305c7245dadb404b3ef23d9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_38886115_8108_4B46_86B1_0AA90E57CCA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl had never seen a book before. ⟪k:1⟫She had heard people describe them, "
"but that was the first time she had ever seen one for herself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs n’avait jamais vu de livre auparavant. ⟪k:1⟫Elle avait déjà "
"entendu des gens en parler, mais c’était la première fois qu’elle en voyait pour de vrai."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5A11CAAD_2C90_4244_B40B_7A4D8700C78D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60fa0ca3f4f4a886e90ccace0b9bbe90889b502d991989d4bca3528fb6daacba
#. default-sha256: 5844bb9cb35a9a8007ecb52c09594476806895c4de6bd8e53ad5268478a88732
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5A11CAAD_2C90_4244_B40B_7A4D8700C78D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Parchment was a very valuable commodity in that era."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le parchemin était une marchandise très chère, à cette époque."

#: scenario4:scenario4_747EC42F_41F5_48AA_8961_BE4879CF3798
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 455c0b2f6682f8515262c20fe24235444843e07bac003939ef448ff572dec9a4
#. default-sha256: a48a56b5b67ebe67b1ba63d76c48f32bd744bf734c35d3f346f6a4974a8259c6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_747EC42F_41F5_48AA_8961_BE4879CF3798"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was something monks or scholarly priests made use of, and not a material one could easily "
"acquire without some degree of social rank."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les moines et les prêtres érudits l’utilisaient mais sinon, on ne pouvait pas en acquérir "
"facilement sans un minimum de rang social."

#: scenario4:scenario4_459918B0_5D9B_44F0_BDDC_30A3C489745D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 075f58b46f766788859f527931862859077cbf26e7c50973f1199d5c0f812b53
#. default-sha256: 378724a7325188d3b1bab162e9c39c2efbad075c74622d9d3e3b257b6cd75c24
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_459918B0_5D9B_44F0_BDDC_30A3C489745D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Books were not printed with machines, but copied by hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les livres n’étaient pas imprimés à la machine mais copiés à la main."

#: scenario4:scenario4_75D69473_E7A3_4283_822D_A10B509FD98E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 016c9a7b28ccf8ea8baf2e201435a2dfbde1805ff3b0be75029a3e2ae42d7d95
#. default-sha256: c385b7153b30ad23cff0442ef5a60a918d2c6642f5ae5c1b90b7b0d175b9b260
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_75D69473_E7A3_4283_822D_A10B509FD98E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A single volume took an incredible amount of work to create.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Even the process of "
"binding was an art."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La création d’un seul volume représentait une charge de travail incroyable.⟪k:1⟫ Rien que le "
"processus de reliure constituait un art en soi."

#: scenario4:scenario4_177E4BD3_3738_4A48_B4A5_4C3CF85F079D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
